<span id="values"></span>
== Freedom Values ==
* [https://github.com/Whonix Open Source] -- We respect user rights to review, scrutinize, modify, and redistribute Whonix. This improves security and privacy for everyone.
* [[Reasons for Freedom Software|Freedom Software]] -- Whonix is Freedom Software and contains software developed by the Free Software Foundation and the GNU Project.
* [[What we do|Research and Implementation Project]] -- Whonix is an actively maintained research project making constant improvements; no shortcomings are ever hidden from users.
* [[Reasons for Freedom Software|Fully Auditable]] -- Whonix is independently verifiable by security experts and software developers around the world. This improves security and privacy for everyone.
* [[Deep scan ready|Deep Scan Ready]] -- Whonix supports offline inspection so you can verify storage and boot components from a clean external environment, without trusting the running system.
* [[Reasons for Freedom Software#No Intentional User Freedom Restrictions|Complete respect for privacy and user freedom]] -- Whonix respects data privacy principles. We don't make advertising deals or collect sensitive personal data.

